# --- n8n state (bbox n8n pull/push) ---
# Encrypted credential exports under production/n8n/credentials/<id>.json MAY be committed
# (they are encrypted with N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY, which must stay OUT of git). NEVER commit a
# decrypted export — block the obvious shapes:
production/n8n/credentials/*decrypted*.json
production/n8n/credentials/*.plain.json
# The blueprint is fully human-readable (workflows/ + credentials/). The owner is sourced from .env
# (N8N_OWNER_*), NOT from any encrypted entities snapshot — so nothing else here needs ignoring.
production/n8n/entities/
data/document-extraction-test-group/
# Large external research clone (not part of the deployment)
data/research/open-hands/
