# --- tenant-specific operational config (never commit) ---
# This deployment's REAL sync registry: connection ids and live Drive folder ids for one
# client. Same category as .env, and the same reason gate G40 bars `sync_registry` from any
# blueprint fixture — a tracked copy would point the next deployment bootstrapped from this
# repo at THIS client's Drive folders on its first seed. The tracked, tenant-neutral shape is
# apps/indox/blueprint/fixtures/sync_registry.example.json.
data/registry/
data/_registry_backup/

