# --- signed app catalog (bbox catalog build) ---
# The built index + app artifacts. Deliberately NOT under .generated/: that tree is compiled config
# and reconcile.py keeps twenty archived generations of it, which would multiply the artifacts by
# twenty. This is a publishable output — upload it, do not commit it.
.catalog/

# --- catalog signing (bbox catalog keygen) ---
# The PUBLIC half lives in platform/trust/keyring.json and IS committed — a fresh clone must
# already trust the catalog this deployment publishes. The SECRET half never leaves the machine.
.catalog-signing-key.json

